(7459169, 1181518, 181814, '<td valign="top">This is great point of view with excellent focus very well composed and I like the long exposure. This is definitely a great-looking photograph that should do well in this contest.</td>', 'This is great point of view with excellent focus very well composed and I like the long exposure. This is definitely a great-looking photograph that should do well in this contest.', '2016-06-07 20:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
