(7459172, 1181957, 181814, '<td valign="top">I am a fan of this sort of photograph and you captured it well I really like your postprocessing and the bright colors throughout the image. The overall image is very well composed and the focus is nice.</td>', 'I am a fan of this sort of photograph and you captured it well I really like your postprocessing and the bright colors throughout the image. The overall image is very well composed and the focus is nice.', '2016-06-07 20:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
