(7459175, 1182036, 181814, '<td valign="top">I really do like this photograph a lot it is very clear and sharp with excellent composition. I like that you caught it with the beak opened it gives it character for sure.</td>', 'I really do like this photograph a lot it is very clear and sharp with excellent composition. I like that you caught it with the beak opened it gives it character for sure.', '2016-06-07 20:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
