(7459337, 1182065, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by odriew:</b></div><hr/><i> Neat:  Yes,  pacific coast highway in California! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Cool! I was only wondering about you the other day, as we visited San Francisco!<br/> <br/>Excellent to have taken this with the iphone, I don''t normally think of taking photo''s with my iphone unless of course I''ve left my camera behind! Anyway was sure this would ribbon, but I guess 6th is pretty good in a FS.<br/> <br/>edited to add; and now I actually see this is the site of Bixby bridge which we saw and stopped and took photo''s of, mines  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1182591" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1182591.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1182591.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1182591.jpg"/></a>pretty boring compared to yours, it was very overcast with flat light.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-06-08 02:41:48.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by odriew: Neat:  Yes,  pacific coast highway in California!   Cool! I was only wondering about you the other day, as we visited San Francisco! Excellent to have taken this with the iphone, I don''t normally think of taking photo''s with my iphone unless of course I''ve left my camera behind! Anyway was sure this would ribbon, but I guess 6th is pretty good in a FS. edited to add; and now I actually see this is the site of Bixby bridge which we saw and stopped and took photo''s of, mines  pretty boring compared to yours, it was very overcast with flat light.', '2016-06-08 03:33:31.000000', '2016-06-08 03:41:48.000000', 0),
